          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_but_real_graphs_dominated_low_degree",
          "text": "But real graphs are dominated by low-degree nodes, and for those nodes even a tiny edge budget can completely rewire the neighbourhood.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
