          "chunk_id": "s02_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c4_raises_fundamental_previously_unansw",
          "text": "That raises a fundamental and previously unanswered question: do these standard perturbations really keep a node's semantic content unchanged, or are we attacking nodes whose true label has already flipped?",
