        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_only_few_works_beyond_simple",
          "text": "Only a few works go beyond simple edge counts, adding proxies like the degree distribution or homophily metrics. None of them directly measure whether the ground-truth label is preserved.",
