          "chunk_id": "s03_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_matters_because_small_perturbation_a",
          "text": "This matters because if a \"small\" perturbation has actually changed a node's true class, then a model that keeps its prediction fixed is not being robustly correct, it is being wrong in a new and hidden way.",
