          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_third_shows_folding_known_label",
          "text": "Third, it shows that folding the known label structure into inference through label propagation significantly reduces over-robustness with no cost to accuracy or adversarial robustness. Fourth, it proves that classifying an inductively sampled node carries no robustness-accuracy tradeoff.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
