      "chunks": [
        {
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c1_key_idea_introduce_trusted_reference",
          "text": "The key idea is to introduce a trusted reference classifier that knows the true semantics. On Contextual Stochastic Block Models the authors can derive the Bayes optimal classifier, which chooses the most likely class given the data, and use it as the ground-truth reference g.",
