          "chunk_id": "s05_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c3_they_measure_over_robustness_one_min",
          "text": "They measure over-robustness as one minus the ratio of semantics-aware robustness to conventional robustness, so a value of zero-point-two means twenty percent of the measured robustness lies beyond semantic change.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
